-- Data migration: seed real "Xizmatlar" (Service) + "Narxlar" (Price)
-- rows for 7 laboratories, sourced from the official SLM price list
-- (slm-xizmatlar-narxlari.md, provided by the client). The
-- Elektromagnit moslashuvchanlik (EMC) lab's services already exist in
-- production (created manually via the admin panel) and are
-- intentionally NOT touched here.
--
-- Uses INSERT ... ON CONFLICT (slug) DO NOTHING on "Service" so this
-- migration is safe even if a matching slug already exists for any
-- reason -- it will never fail the whole batch or duplicate a row.
-- Each "Price" row's serviceId is resolved via a slug subquery instead
-- of a captured id, so it always points at whichever Service row ends
-- up existing (freshly inserted here, or pre-existing).




















































































